.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-SYSTEM 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-system
.Nd host and stack diagnostics from the admin API
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad system
.Op Cm info | debug | internet
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
queries the admin service API and pretty-prints the JSON response.
The admin service must be up.
.Pp
The optional argument selects which report to fetch.
With no argument,
.Nm
returns
.Cm info .
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm info
System information report.
This is the default.
.It Cm debug
Extended debug information report.
.It Cm internet
Internet connectivity status.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad system
Fetch the system information report.
.It Ic nomad system internet
Check whether the host has internet connectivity.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-check 1
